### Create MCP Key
# Returns rawToken once — save it immediately.
POST {{artel_url}}/api/vaults/{{vault_id}}/mcp-keys
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "my-llm-key"
}

### List MCP Keys
GET {{artel_url}}/api/vaults/{{vault_id}}/mcp-keys
Authorization: {{auth_token}}

### Revoke MCP Key
DELETE {{artel_url}}/api/vaults/{{vault_id}}/mcp-keys/{{mcp_key_id}}
Authorization: {{auth_token}}
